<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>티엔이엔씨(주) | TN E&C - 산업플랜트·GMP·스마트 엔지니어링 종합건설</title>
  <meta name="description" content="산업플랜트, GMP/HACCP, Bio Medical, R&D 연구시설 및 일반건축 전문 종합건설사 티엔이엔씨(주)" />

  <!-- 웹폰트 (Pretendard & Montserrat) -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" as="style" crossorigin href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <!-- Font Awesome 아이콘 -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" />

  <style>
    /* ================================================================
       CSS Variables & Reset
    ================================================================ */
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0f141d;
      --bg-surface: #171f2c;
      --bg-surface-light: #222d3d;
      --bg-light: #f8fafc;
      --text-main: #0f172a;
      --text-muted: #64748b;
      --text-white: #ffffff;
      --text-dim-white: #cbd5e1;
      
      /* TN E&C Brand Identity */
      --tn-red: #e30613;
      --tn-yellow: #f59e0b;
      --tn-accent: #2563eb;
      --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      --transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: var(--text-main);
      overflow-x: hidden;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    ul, ol {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .section-title-wrap {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }

    .section-subtitle {
      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--tn-red);
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 2.3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .section-desc {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    /* ================================================================
       1. Header & Navigation
    ================================================================ */
    header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 80px;
      background: rgba(15, 20, 29, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      z-index: 1000;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    header.scrolled {
      height: 72px;
      background: rgba(15, 20, 29, 0.98);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 100%;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      color: #fff;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .logo-badge {
      background: var(--tn-red);
      color: #fff;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .nav-menu {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 36px;
    }

    .nav-item a {
      color: var(--text-dim-white);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      transition: var(--transition);
      position: relative;
      padding: 6px 0;
    }

    .nav-item a:hover,
    .nav-item a.active {
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .nav-item a::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 0%;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--tn-red);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .nav-item a:hover::after,
    .nav-item a.active::after {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .header-right {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .btn-contact {
      background: var(--tn-red);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 10px 22px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      transition: var(--transition);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .btn-contact:hover {
      background: #b9050f;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .mobile-menu-btn {
      display: none;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* ================================================================
       2. Hero / Main Visual
    ================================================================ */
    .hero-section {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 20, 29, 0.94) 0%, rgba(23, 31, 44, 0.82) 100%),
                  url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541888946425-d0fbb1861564?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding-top: 100px;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 820px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      padding: 8px 18px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .hero-badge i {
      color: var(--tn-yellow);
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    .hero-title span {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff, #cbd5e1);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-title .highlight {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff6b6b, var(--tn-red));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-desc {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--text-dim-white);
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    .hero-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 50px;
      padding-top: 36px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    .stat-item h4 {
      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .stat-item h4 span {
      color: var(--tn-yellow);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .stat-item p {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-dim-white);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* ================================================================
       3. Projects (프로젝트 사례들)
    ================================================================ */
    .projects-section {
      padding: 110px 0;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .project-tabs {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .tab-btn {
      padding: 10px 22px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 40px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .tab-btn.active, .tab-btn:hover {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: var(--bg-surface);
    }

    .project-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .project-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      transition: var(--transition);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
    }

    .project-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
    }

    .project-thumb {
      height: 220px;
      position: relative;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
    }

    .project-category {
      position: absolute;
      top: 16px;
      left: 16px;
      background: rgba(15, 20, 29, 0.85);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    }

    .project-info {
      padding: 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .project-client {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--tn-red);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .project-name {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1e293b;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .project-meta {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #64748b;
      margin-top: auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
      padding-top: 14px;
    }

    /* ================================================================
       4. Technology (회사기술 및 스마트건설 역량)
    ================================================================ */
    .technology-section {
      padding: 110px 0;
      background: var(--bg-dark);
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .technology-section .section-title {
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .tech-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .tech-card {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 36px 30px;
      transition: var(--transition);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .tech-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 3px;
      background: var(--border-color);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .tech-card:hover {
      background: var(--bg-surface-light);
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .tech-card:hover::before {
      background: var(--tn-red);
    }

    .tech-icon {
      width: 58px;
      height: 58px;
      background: rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.3);
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--tn-red);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .tech-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .tech-card p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-dim-white);
      line-height: 1.6;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    .tech-list {
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }

    .tech-list li {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .tech-list li i {
      color: var(--tn-yellow);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }

    /* 스마트 건설 배너 */
    .smart-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1e293b, #0f172a);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      padding: 40px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .smart-banner-info h4 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .smart-banner-info p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .smart-tags {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .smart-tag {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* ================================================================
       5. News / Notice (회사소식)
    ================================================================ */
    .news-section {
      padding: 110px 0;
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    .news-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .news-card {
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 28px;
      transition: var(--transition);
      background: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .news-card:hover {
      border-color: #cbd5e1;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .news-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--tn-accent);
      background: #eff6ff;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      align-self: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .news-title {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0f172a;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .news-snippet {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .news-date {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #94a3b8;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    /* ================================================================
       6. Location (회사위치)
    ================================================================ */
    .location-section {
      padding: 110px 0;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .location-wrapper {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .location-info {
      padding: 48px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .location-info h3 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .contact-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .contact-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--tn-red);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .contact-text strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #334155;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .contact-text p, .contact-text a {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .location-map-container {
      background: #0f172a;
      position: relative;
      min-height: 400px;
    }

    .map-placeholder {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b, #0f172a);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .map-pin {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      background: var(--tn-red);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.2);
    }

    /* ================================================================
       7. Footer
    ================================================================ */
    footer {
      background: #090d14;
      color: #94a3b8;
      padding: 80px 0 30px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .footer-top {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 50px;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
      padding-bottom: 50px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .footer-brand .logo {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .footer-brand p {
      max-width: 420px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .footer-links h5 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .footer-links ul li {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .footer-links ul li a {
      color: #94a3b8;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .footer-links ul li a:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      padding-left: 4px;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .company-reg-info {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    /* ================================================================
       Responsive
    ================================================================ */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .project-grid, .tech-grid, .news-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
      .location-wrapper {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .footer-top {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero-title {
        font-size: 2.4rem;
      }
      .hero-stats {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
      .project-grid, .tech-grid, .news-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .nav-menu {
        display: none;
      }
      .mobile-menu-btn {
        display: block;
      }
      .smart-banner {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ================================================================
       1. Header
  ================================================================ -->
  <header id="header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="#home" class="logo">
        <div class="logo-badge">N</div>
        <span>TN E&C</span>
      </a>

      <!-- GNB Menu -->
      <nav>
        <ul class="nav-menu">
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="#home" class="active">HOME</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="#technology">BUSINESS</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="#projects">PROJECT</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="#technology">TECHNOLOGY</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="#about">ABOUT</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="#news">NEWS</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <div class="header-right">
        <a href="#location" class="btn-contact">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> 문의하기
        </a>
        <button class="mobile-menu-btn" aria-label="메뉴 열기">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ================================================================
       2. Hero / Main Visual
  ================================================================ -->
  <section id="home" class="hero-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badge">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> 산업플랜트·바이오·스마트엔지니어링 전문
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          미래를 설계하는 첨단 엔지니어링,<br />
          신뢰의 종합건설 파트너 <span class="highlight">TN E&C</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          티엔이엔씨(주)는 첨단 GMP·HACCP 공장, R&D 연구시설 및 바이오 플랜트 분야에서 
          축적된 3D BIM 가상 시공과 고도화된 직영 기술력으로 완벽한 품질과 최적의 공기를 실현합니다.
        </p>
        <div>
